lcsnap-2025-02-03-17h40m50s433.png", "id": "635622445647915", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473398258_635622448981248_3438246790668467954_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5UFGbGqzEgYQ7kNvwFfdcNW&_nc_oc=AdnaIAMcMWgs9mzQFRnlBqI9RWVtfCY6wZx2WMnf_fQEhI98fGBlgWukuWF8NrVOUKE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyQHpAUG3jnMcMFJY0_SnrvX4ohU96bp6Bil4nLLoboHQ&oe=69AC0DD6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Certified HVAC Associate", "keywords": ["HVAC", "ImmerseLearn", "VR", "Training"], "long_description": "Certified HVAC Associate is a comprehensive VR training app designed to provide hands-on experience in HVAC fundamentals. This interactive simulation covers:\n\n- Fire Extinguisher Essentials: Learn proper handling and usage.\n- Personal Protective Equipment (PPE) \u2013 Understand safety best practices.\n- Basic Tools & Equipment: Master essential HVAC tools.\n- Copper Tubing Essentials: Explore cutting, bending, and joining techniques.\n- Refrigeration System & Refrigerator: Understand system components and operation.\n- Electrical Components & Controls: Learn wiring and troubleshooting.\n- Wiring Diagram Interpretation: Develop skills in reading and applying diagrams.\n\nTrain in a risk-free, realistic environment that enhances learning and skill retention. Whether you're an aspiring technician or an industry professional, this app prepares you for real-world HVAC scenarios. Start your training today!", "short_description": "Master essential HVAC skills in an immersive VR training experience! Certified HVAC Associate covers fire extinguisher safety, PPE, tools, copper tubing, refrigeration systems, electrical components, wiring, and more. Train in a realistic virtual environment to enhance hands-on expertise, improve safety awareness, and build a strong foundation for a successful HVAC career."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "htt